[211.2069,"o","\u001b[?25l\u001b[5G\u001b[1K\u001b[Cbevacizumab-specific safety signal.\u001b[K\r\n     \u001b[K\u001b[3;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[COS and PFS are the primary endpoints; PFS \u2264 OS holds in all 1,800 rows.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[5;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[1m\u001b[CThings worth knowing before you clean\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[K\r\n \u001b[K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[C- \u001b[1mUnit conversion is mandatory for Format B.\u001b[m\u000f Albumin g/L (24\u201352) vs g/dL (2.4\u20135.2) \u2014 a factor of\u00a010.\u001b[K\u001b[8;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[C  Bilirubin \u00b5mol/L (3.4\u201354.5) vs mg/dL (0.2\u20133.1) \u2014 divide by 17.1. Concatenating without converting\u001b[K\u001b[9;4H\u001b[1K\u001b[Csilently corrupts 620 patients' liver function.\u001b[K\r\n  - \u001b[1mFormat C (560 patients) has no continuous AFP\u001b[m\u000f \u2014 only the \u2265400 dichotomy. Any AFP-as-continuous\u001b[K\u001b[11;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[C  analysis is restricted to 1,240 patients, or you dichotomise everyone.\u001b[K\u001b[12;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[C- \u001b[1mMissingness is confined to labs and AFP\u001b[m\u000f, roughly 4\u20136% each: albumin 78, bilirubin 91, AFP 75 (of\u001b[K\u001b[13;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[C  1,240 eligible). Outcomes, arm, and demographics are complete.\u001b[K\r\n  - \u001b[1mFormat C loses enrolment month\u001b[m\u000f \u2014 year only, so 2 distinct val"]
