[1280.393209,"o","\u001b[1;7Halloca\u001b[Cion was confounded with\u001b[Ccentre\u001b[Ctype\u001b[C(SMD\u001b[C0.38),\u001b[Cand\u001b[CH10\u001b[Cshowed\u001b[Ca\u001b[Cnull\u001b[Ceffect.\u001b[CA\u001b[Creviewer\u001b[Cwho\u001b[2;7Hreads\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Cmethods\u001b[Cwill\u001b[Cask.\u001b[3;3H\u001b[K\nTwo\u001b[Ccommitments\u001b[Cabout\u001b[Chow\u001b[CI'll\u001b[Crun\u001b[Cthem:\u001b[5;3H\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mThe interaction test is the inferential quantity, not the within-subgroup p-value.\u001b[m\u000f \"Significant\u001b[Cin\u001b[CHBV,\u001b[7;3Hnot in HCV\" is the cl\u001b[Cssic subgroup fallacy \u2014 it mostly\u001b[Creflects\u001b[Csubgroup\u001b[Csize.\u001b[CI'll\u001b[Creport\u001b[8;3Hp-interaction\u001b[Cper\u001b[Cdomain\u001b[Cand\u001b[Cjudge\u001b[Cconsistency\u001b[Con\u001b[Cthat.\u001b[9;3H\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mThese are exploratory.\u001b[C\u001b[m\u000fTwelve inter\u001b[Cction \u001b[Cests me\u001b[Cns roughly a\u001b[C46% chance of\u001b[Cat\u001b[Cleast one p\u001b[C< 0.05 by\u001b[11;3Hchance\u001b[Calone. I'll\u001b[Csay so rather than t\u001b[Ce\u001b[2C a hit\u001b[Cas \u001b[C finding.\u001b[CEach subgroup HR is\u001b[Cadjusted the\u001b[Csame\u001b[12;3Hw\u001b[Cy \u001b[Cs the p\u001b[Cimary model \u2014\u001b[?25l"]
